message: >-
  If you use Urban4 or its generated benchmark models, please cite this
  software release.
title: "Urban4: Reproducible Generation and Coupling of Urban Infrastructure Networks"
type: software
version: 2.9.0
date-released: 2026-08-14
authors:
  - family-names: Pant
    given-names: Prashant
    affiliation: Technical University of Munich
  - family-names: Hamacher
    given-names: Thomas
    affiliation: Technical University of Munich
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Prashantgrid/Urban4"
url: "https://github.com/Prashantgrid/Urban4"
abstract: >-
  Urban4 generates aligned electricity, drinking-water, wastewater, and
  optional district-heating networks from a common geospatial evidence model.
  It retains sector-specific topology and native-solver execution while
  storing explicit powered-facility and building-level cross-sector
  interfaces.
